1
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:17,750
[Pangzhou Huangsha Station]

2
00:01:16,789 --> 00:01:18,380
Someone's dead!

3
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:20,470
[A Prophet]

4
00:03:21,190 --> 00:03:23,410
[Episode 4]

5
00:03:26,079 --> 00:03:27,250
Is it done?

6
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:28,600
It's done.

7
00:03:33,079 --> 00:03:33,880
What's wrong?

8
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,520
You don't look happy.

9
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:41,100
Whether it's Old Madam Zhu

10
00:03:41,570 --> 00:03:42,640
or Lyu Ruhui,

11
00:03:43,970 --> 00:03:45,570
they got what they deserved.

12
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:49,010
But hurting someone completely innocent...

13
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,320
I'm afraid

14
00:03:52,450 --> 00:03:54,450
I'll become more and more like them.

15
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:59,600
Once we decided
to go after the Tianxiang Sect,

16
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:01,060
there was no turning back.

17
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,040
I know.

18
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:07,780
We've been preparing for this day

19
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:13,760
for far too long.

20
00:04:20,350 --> 00:04:25,770
[Eight years ago]

21
00:04:20,490 --> 00:04:21,279
Mentor,

22
00:04:21,610 --> 00:04:23,300
I just can't make heads or tails of
the incantations in the Yingyao Rhapsody,

23
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:25,300
no matter how many times I read them.

24
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,400
It's all coded language.

25
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:28,400
No wonder you can't make sense of it.

26
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,650
This first line:

27
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,200
"upon meeting a client,
discern their intent;

28
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:33,010
when you speak, don't hesitate."

29
00:04:33,010 --> 00:04:35,280
It means that
when you're telling someone's fortune,

30
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,890
you should listen more than you speak,

31
00:04:36,890 --> 00:04:38,490
then seize the right moment
to hit the nail on the head,

32
00:04:38,490 --> 00:04:38,890
right?

33
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:39,640
Exactly.

34
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,860
But the next four lines...

35
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:43,610
These next four lines

36
00:04:43,610 --> 00:04:45,409
are all about the wisdom of life.

37
00:04:46,010 --> 00:04:47,810
You need to look and reflect—

38
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:49,400
to look at all things,

39
00:04:49,420 --> 00:04:51,540
understand life's joys and sorrows,

40
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:53,370
and observe.

41
00:04:54,370 --> 00:04:55,280
Observe?

42
00:05:12,580 --> 00:05:13,580
Bamboo baskets!

43
00:05:13,610 --> 00:05:14,890
Check it out.

44
00:05:14,890 --> 00:05:16,520
Freshly woven bamboo baskets!

45
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:18,160
Big ones, small ones—

46
00:05:18,450 --> 00:05:19,160
take a look!

47
00:05:19,370 --> 00:05:20,200
Come get one!

48
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:33,370
Upon meeting a client,
discern their intent;

49
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:35,320
when you speak, don't hesitate.

50
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:38,570
If a father asks about his son,
he wants to know if his son will prosper.

51
00:05:38,570 --> 00:05:41,159
If a father asks about his son,
he wants to know if his son will prosper.

52
00:05:41,159 --> 00:05:44,280
If a son asks about his father,
he's worried about his father's health.

53
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:47,450
If a son asks about his father,
he's worried about his father's health.

54
00:05:47,450 --> 00:05:49,720
If a parent comes
to have their child's fortune told,

55
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:52,840
they're usually asking whether the child
will make something of himself

56
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:54,890
and lead a life of wealth and success.

57
00:05:54,890 --> 00:05:58,020
When a child comes
to have their parent's fortunes told,

58
00:05:58,280 --> 00:06:00,610
it's always because the parent
is in poor health—

59
00:06:00,610 --> 00:06:02,740
whether they're ill or nearing death.

60
00:06:03,110 --> 00:06:06,690
Those are the things children worry about
most when it comes to their parents.

61
00:06:06,690 --> 00:06:08,280
A wife asks about her husband.

62
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,130
A wife asks about her husband.

63
00:06:09,130 --> 00:06:11,890
Those who come happily hope
to share in their husbands' success.

64
00:06:11,890 --> 00:06:13,160
Those who come happily hope
to share in their husbands' success.

65
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:15,930
Those who come sorrowfully
are truly worried about their husbands.

66
00:06:15,930 --> 00:06:17,720
Those who come sorrowfully
are truly worried about their husbands.

67
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,840
When a wife

68
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:21,570
comes to ask about her husband's future,

69
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,320
if she comes in high spirits,

70
00:06:23,490 --> 00:06:24,620
it means her husband

71
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:26,770
may soon rise in rank or make a fortune.

72
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:29,400
But if she looks troubled,

73
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:32,520
either her husband
has lost his position or fortune,

74
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:35,080
or he's thinking of leaving her.

75
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:37,320
A husband asks about his wife.

76
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:38,159
A husband asks about his wife.

77
00:06:38,159 --> 00:06:39,280
If the matter doesn't involve the wife,

78
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:40,320
If the matter doesn't involve the wife,

79
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:42,840
it must be about difficulties
having children.

80
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:45,010
it must be about difficulties
having children.

81
00:06:45,010 --> 00:06:46,159
A man

82
00:06:46,370 --> 00:06:48,250
who comes to have his wife's fortune told

83
00:06:48,250 --> 00:06:50,080
does so for only two possible reasons.

84
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:50,490
Either

85
00:06:50,890 --> 00:06:53,080
he suspects she's been unfaithful,

86
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:54,450
or they're having trouble

87
00:06:54,450 --> 00:06:55,760
having children.

88
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:59,580
Otherwise, a man would never
have his wife's fortune told.

89
00:07:00,610 --> 00:07:02,410
A scholar asks about his future.

90
00:07:02,450 --> 00:07:03,840
A scholar asks about his future.

91
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:06,130
A wealthy man asks
about his remaining years.

92
00:07:06,130 --> 00:07:07,720
A wealthy man asks
about his remaining years.

93
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:08,690
This means

94
00:07:09,010 --> 00:07:11,200
scholars usually ask
about their prospects—

95
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,610
whether they'll pass the exams

96
00:07:12,610 --> 00:07:14,570
and whether they'll become officials.

97
00:07:14,570 --> 00:07:15,840
As for the wealthy,

98
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,960
they always ask about their longevity.

99
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:19,520
They have plenty of money

100
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:20,760
and fear nothing

101
00:07:20,780 --> 00:07:22,510
except not living long enough.

102
00:07:23,050 --> 00:07:24,810
Those high-ranking officials...

103
00:07:24,810 --> 00:07:25,930
Those high-ranking officials...

104
00:07:25,930 --> 00:07:27,490
Claim to have their hearts set
on the mountains and forests.

105
00:07:27,490 --> 00:07:28,840
Claim to have their hearts set
on the mountains and forests.

106
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,570
Those high-ranking officials

107
00:07:30,570 --> 00:07:32,040
actually have greater ambitions

108
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,220
and stronger desires for personal gain.

109
00:07:33,220 --> 00:07:35,200
If I tempt them with wealth and power,

110
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:36,860
they'll surely be delighted.

111
00:07:37,050 --> 00:07:38,610
You're a quick learner.

112
00:07:39,159 --> 00:07:41,159
So you must observe carefully

113
00:07:41,330 --> 00:07:43,790
and read the present situation accurately.

114
00:07:43,850 --> 00:07:46,640
Tomorrow, I'll set up my stall
and tell fortunes.

115
00:07:47,250 --> 00:07:48,760
You come along and watch.

116
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:55,670
[Legendary Fortune Teller]

117
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:11,080
Fortune-teller,

118
00:08:11,860 --> 00:08:13,890
how much do you charge for a reading?

119
00:08:15,610 --> 00:08:16,870
No charge if I'm wrong.

120
00:08:16,910 --> 00:08:18,200
And if you're right?

121
00:08:18,220 --> 00:08:19,950
Pay whatever you think is fair.

122
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:25,640
All right.

123
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:31,810
Please.

124
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:50,250
How do you interpret this reading?

125
00:08:50,250 --> 00:08:51,510
Your surname is Zhang,

126
00:08:52,490 --> 00:08:53,440
Z-h-a-n-g.

127
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,360
That's right.

128
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,640
My name is Zhang Feng.

129
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,570
How did you know?

130
00:08:56,680 --> 00:08:57,520
Who are you

131
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,920
asking about?

132
00:08:59,090 --> 00:08:59,760
My wife.

133
00:09:00,130 --> 00:09:02,260
Your wife's condition isn't serious.

134
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:04,400
How did you know my wife was ill?

135
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:06,330
Go north to seek medical treatment.

136
00:09:06,330 --> 00:09:07,330
That should do it.

137
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:09,890
I just went to see a doctor north
of the city.

138
00:09:09,890 --> 00:09:10,490
You...

139
00:09:10,730 --> 00:09:12,100
You figured all that out from the reading?

140
00:09:12,100 --> 00:09:13,630
Hurry and get the medicine.

141
00:09:14,020 --> 00:09:16,950
Once she takes it,
the Zhang family will have an heir.

142
00:09:17,890 --> 00:09:18,400
Master,

143
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:19,560
you're incredible!

144
00:09:19,590 --> 00:09:20,400
My wife hasn't gotten pregnant

145
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:22,040
in two years!

146
00:09:22,250 --> 00:09:23,610
It's all fate.

147
00:09:23,890 --> 00:09:25,460
What is meant to come will come in time.

148
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:26,940
Let me congratulate you in advance.

149
00:09:26,940 --> 00:09:27,800
Thank you, Master.

150
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:28,860
Thank you, Master.

151
00:09:28,890 --> 00:09:30,370
Master, here's just a little token
of my appreciation.

152
00:09:30,370 --> 00:09:32,800
Thank you! Thank you!

153
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:33,250
Congratulations, congratulations.

154
00:09:33,250 --> 00:09:34,610
Thank you, Master.

155
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:36,640
Let's have the Master read ours, too.

156
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:37,130
Master,

157
00:09:37,130 --> 00:09:38,640
read ours too, please.

158
00:09:52,930 --> 00:09:54,590
How did you get it all so right?

159
00:10:00,060 --> 00:10:02,190
I didn't tell his fortune. I observed.

160
00:10:02,420 --> 00:10:03,890
You could even tell his surname
through observation?

161
00:10:03,890 --> 00:10:05,050
There was something

162
00:10:05,670 --> 00:10:07,470
embroidered on his money pouch:

163
00:10:07,630 --> 00:10:08,490
"Bairen Hall."

164
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:10,740
Everyone from Bairen Hall

165
00:10:10,930 --> 00:10:11,990
is surnamed Zhang.

166
00:10:13,090 --> 00:10:14,220
Then how did you know

167
00:10:14,540 --> 00:10:16,130
he was having his wife's fortune told,

168
00:10:16,130 --> 00:10:18,290
and that she was the one who was ill?

169
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:21,930
I saw the prescription he was holding.

170
00:10:22,670 --> 00:10:25,500
Then how did you know
he was asking about having children?

171
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:27,160
A husband asks about his wife.

172
00:10:27,370 --> 00:10:28,800
If the matter doesn't involve the wife,

173
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:31,460
it must be about difficulties
having children.

174
00:10:37,330 --> 00:10:38,490
Then how did you know

175
00:10:38,650 --> 00:10:40,610
he was going north
to seek medical treatment?

176
00:10:40,610 --> 00:10:42,890
The wind was blowing from the south
when it rained.

177
00:10:42,890 --> 00:10:44,490
The front of his body was already dry,

178
00:10:44,490 --> 00:10:46,820
but his back and shoulders were still wet.

179
00:10:46,890 --> 00:10:49,890
So he must have been traveling
from south to north.

180
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:55,000
You just got lucky
and happened to guess right.

181
00:11:02,530 --> 00:11:04,210
The tickets are already booked.

182
00:11:04,210 --> 00:11:05,410
We're leaving today.

183
00:11:05,660 --> 00:11:07,840
Now that we've finally built up
a bit of a reputation,

184
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:10,760
why not keep setting up our stall
instead of leaving?

185
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:12,130
Whether our readings are accurate or not,

186
00:11:12,130 --> 00:11:13,680
the future will tell.

187
00:11:14,210 --> 00:11:16,330
Maybe if we set up
our stall again tomorrow,

188
00:11:16,330 --> 00:11:18,210
someone will come and wreck it.

189
00:11:27,850 --> 00:11:28,610
Qianshan?

190
00:11:28,710 --> 00:11:29,570
Yes, Qianshan.

191
00:11:29,890 --> 00:11:30,800
Qianshan.

192
00:11:31,130 --> 00:11:33,500
[Qianshan Station]

193
00:11:31,670 --> 00:11:32,870
Looking for Blind Du?

194
00:11:33,390 --> 00:11:33,720
No.

195
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:35,760
Wait for him to come find you.

196
00:11:42,490 --> 00:11:43,610
Slow down.

197
00:11:43,730 --> 00:11:44,330
All right,

198
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:45,330
put it down here.

199
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,040
Here it is.

200
00:11:57,610 --> 00:11:58,060
Master,

201
00:11:58,060 --> 00:11:59,270
you're finally back.

202
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,730
The whole courtyard has been cleaned up.

203
00:12:00,730 --> 00:12:01,400
Have a look.

204
00:12:01,610 --> 00:12:02,210
Come here.

205
00:12:02,210 --> 00:12:03,010
Coming.

206
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,880
This place is truly blessed.

207
00:12:05,090 --> 00:12:06,130
Over the next few days,

208
00:12:06,130 --> 00:12:08,280
I'll invite all kinds of immortals
to descend to the mortal world.

209
00:12:08,280 --> 00:12:10,640
Seven days from now, we'll hold
a ritual to honor the immortals.

210
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:11,560
When the time comes,

211
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:13,250
bring your friends and relatives

212
00:12:13,250 --> 00:12:14,760
and come pay your respects.

213
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:15,680
All right.

214
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:16,610
We'll all come.

215
00:12:16,610 --> 00:12:17,740
We definitely will,

216
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,010
Master.

217
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:42,440
Purple smoke!

218
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:44,370
Is this the auspicious purple qi
coming from the east?

219
00:12:44,370 --> 00:12:45,560
This is a great omen!

220
00:12:45,730 --> 00:12:47,040
The immortals have answered our prayers!

221
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:48,920
The immortals have answered our prayers!

222
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:50,920
The immortals have answered our prayers!

223
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:52,130
The immortals have answered our prayers!

224
00:12:52,130 --> 00:12:53,520
During these days
of inviting the immortals,

225
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:54,970
the auspicious sign
of purple qi coming from the east

226
00:12:54,970 --> 00:12:56,170
can be seen every day.

227
00:12:56,330 --> 00:12:58,260
There's nothing unusual about it.

228
00:13:01,520 --> 00:13:02,520
The purple smoke

229
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:03,890
will dissipate in an hour,

230
00:13:03,890 --> 00:13:05,090
and then it will rain.

231
00:13:06,850 --> 00:13:08,160
You'd better head home soon.

232
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:09,760
The weather is so nice today.

233
00:13:09,850 --> 00:13:11,010
How could it rain?

234
00:13:11,090 --> 00:13:12,130
It definitely will.

235
00:13:12,130 --> 00:13:13,330
You have to trust him.

236
00:13:13,490 --> 00:13:15,280
He's a deity descended
to the mortal world.

237
00:13:15,280 --> 00:13:17,610
If he says it will rain,
you can bet it will.

238
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:30,370
It's raining!

239
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,640
It really is!

240
00:13:33,850 --> 00:13:35,160
It really is!

241
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:39,760
I'll ask Master to read my fortune first.

242
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:41,400
When will I be able to get married?

243
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:42,040
Come on,

244
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:43,370
let's have Master read ours too.

245
00:13:43,370 --> 00:13:43,970
Come on,

246
00:13:44,010 --> 00:13:44,610
come on.

247
00:13:44,730 --> 00:13:46,060
I'm going too. Let's go!

248
00:13:46,980 --> 00:13:49,110
[Yongzhen Taoist Temple]

249
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:54,010
Come on, everyone.
This is Yongzhen Taoist Temple.

250
00:13:54,010 --> 00:13:55,090
A celestial being has descended
to the mortal realm.

251
00:13:55,090 --> 00:13:56,970
The purple smoke
is a great omen of good fortune.

252
00:13:56,970 --> 00:14:00,100
It's truly miraculous.
Hurry and go see for yourselves!

253
00:14:00,310 --> 00:14:03,510
♪ A, B, C, D, E ♪

254
00:14:03,540 --> 00:14:06,260
♪ Spouting nonsense endlessly ♪

255
00:14:06,290 --> 00:14:09,010
♪ Smoke and breath, drawn in and out ♪

256
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:12,020
♪ Yellow paper charms,
half mad, half divine ♪

257
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:15,350
♪ Heaven's Stems and Earthly Branches,
he waves them about ♪

258
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:18,380
♪ Five Elements, Eight Trigrams,
all smoke and mirrors ♪

259
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:21,200
♪ The fortune-teller's tongue
is full of lies ♪

260
00:14:21,230 --> 00:14:24,210
♪ Blows from the front,
arrows from behind, dark thoughts strike ♪

261
00:14:51,550 --> 00:14:52,220
Break!

262
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:57,480
-It moved!
-It moved!

263
00:15:01,700 --> 00:15:03,360
Immortals, take your places.

264
00:15:05,730 --> 00:15:06,930
-It's lit!
-It's lit!

265
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:15,560
Today, I gather
with the immortals for a feast,

266
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:17,960
offering them Penglai longevity noodles.

267
00:15:17,990 --> 00:15:20,560
May the immortals bless the people

268
00:15:20,890 --> 00:15:22,890
of this land with peace and prosperity.

269
00:15:22,890 --> 00:15:23,890
I heard only a grandmaster

270
00:15:23,890 --> 00:15:25,850
with boundless powers

271
00:15:25,850 --> 00:15:27,730
could dine with the Immortals.

272
00:15:29,130 --> 00:15:30,330
Who is this kid?

273
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:47,400
Look,

274
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:48,890
he has finished eating.

275
00:15:57,330 --> 00:15:59,330
Can he really summon the Immortals?

276
00:15:59,330 --> 00:16:00,090
Just watch.

277
00:16:02,970 --> 00:16:03,630
Look, look!

278
00:16:05,940 --> 00:16:08,730
Thank you, Immortals,
for gracing us with your presence.

279
00:16:08,730 --> 00:16:10,990
The Immortals have finished the noodles

280
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:14,370
and bestowed sacred water upon me.

281
00:16:16,040 --> 00:16:17,010
The Immortals

282
00:16:17,890 --> 00:16:19,090
really did finish them.

283
00:16:19,090 --> 00:16:20,490
Where did the noodles go?

284
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:24,160
The sacred water falls to the earth,

285
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:30,330
blessing generations to come.

286
00:16:31,430 --> 00:16:33,030
The noodles are really gone.

287
00:16:33,370 --> 00:16:34,230
Unbelievable!

288
00:16:34,610 --> 00:16:36,130
The noodles vanished

289
00:16:36,130 --> 00:16:37,040
in the blink of an eye.

290
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:38,770
He is the only one
on that altar.

291
00:16:38,890 --> 00:16:40,280
Exactly, it's just him.

292
00:16:40,980 --> 00:16:43,100
Today, I've prepared

293
00:16:43,130 --> 00:16:44,530
some herbs for all of you.

294
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:45,880
Don't worry about it.

295
00:16:46,290 --> 00:16:47,750
They're completely free.

296
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:50,380
The Immortals have manifested themselves!

297
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:52,730
The Immortals have manifested themselves!

298
00:16:52,730 --> 00:16:55,190
The Immortals have manifested themselves!

299
00:17:01,800 --> 00:17:03,280
Thank you.

300
00:18:03,090 --> 00:18:05,620
May I ask what manner of hero
I'm dealing with?

301
00:18:06,370 --> 00:18:08,050
Let's talk it out.

302
00:18:08,610 --> 00:18:10,090
There's no need for this.

303
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:12,770
Turf?

304
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,000
Pei County, Xuzhou.

305
00:18:31,290 --> 00:18:32,690
Who is your grandmaster?

306
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,600
No gang. I work alone.

307
00:18:35,130 --> 00:18:35,850
Years in?

308
00:18:36,050 --> 00:18:36,480
Woof.

309
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:37,850
Ever killed anyone?

310
00:18:37,850 --> 00:18:38,720
Never.

311
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:45,200
[Blind Du, Grandmaster
of the Longxuya Branch, Tianxiang Sect]

312
00:18:50,970 --> 00:18:51,720
That trick of yours—

313
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:53,200
the one where the Immortal
eats the noodles.

314
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:54,370
How does it work?

315
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:56,370
Tell me about it.

316
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:01,530
A man doesn't give away
the secrets of his trade.

317
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:09,400
You've got some nerve,

318
00:19:09,780 --> 00:19:12,910
setting up shop on my Longxuya turf.

319
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:15,130
You think you're walking out of here alive

320
00:19:15,130 --> 00:19:17,130
without leaving something behind?

321
00:19:17,770 --> 00:19:20,030
I don't understand a word you're saying.

322
00:19:20,330 --> 00:19:21,160
Forget it.

323
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,200
Drag him out

324
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:24,050
and chop him up for the dogs.

325
00:19:24,130 --> 00:19:24,720
Yes.

326
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:27,850
Six clashes turn into the noble Tianyi;

327
00:19:27,850 --> 00:19:29,480
stepping on Abao, untouched by dust.

328
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:30,290
Hold on.

329
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:39,160
So you're one of our own.

330
00:19:40,770 --> 00:19:41,530
Tell me,

331
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:44,090
what brings you to see me?

332
00:19:44,700 --> 00:19:46,530
I just arrived in Qianshan from Pangzhou.

333
00:19:46,530 --> 00:19:47,730
With no one to turn to,

334
00:19:48,330 --> 00:19:50,440
I came to seek shelter
with the Longxuya Branch.

335
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:51,290
Pangzhou?

336
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:53,640
What's your name?

337
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:58,440
I'm a 33rd-generation disciple
of the Muzilian Branch,

338
00:19:58,440 --> 00:19:59,330
Lyu Ruhui.

339
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:01,000
I pay my respects, Master Du.

340
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:03,960
Well.

341
00:20:04,570 --> 00:20:06,130
I was just looking for you.

342
00:20:06,570 --> 00:20:08,480
Look who came knocking.

343
00:20:09,670 --> 00:20:10,540
Hu Guangyuan,

344
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:11,660
Song Bingzhang,

345
00:20:11,690 --> 00:20:12,250
Du Gui—

346
00:20:12,270 --> 00:20:13,230
you know them?

347
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:15,440
I do.

348
00:20:17,370 --> 00:20:19,520
After stirring up such a commotion,

349
00:20:19,640 --> 00:20:21,640
you still dared to come to Qianshan?

350
00:20:21,890 --> 00:20:24,160
You've certainly got guts.

351
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:26,440
With your tricks
of making the Immortals eat noodles

352
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:28,170
and conjuring up purple smoke,

353
00:20:28,960 --> 00:20:30,640
you're quite the talent.

354
00:20:31,690 --> 00:20:33,420
If we'd met a few years earlier,

355
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:36,400
I might really have
taken you on as a disciple.

356
00:20:37,130 --> 00:20:38,570
What a shame.

357
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:40,370
Chief Du,

358
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:43,740
I can explain what happened in Pangzhou.

359
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,050
Four people are dead,

360
00:20:45,050 --> 00:20:46,090
and we lost so much money.

361
00:20:46,090 --> 00:20:47,160
How do you explain that?

362
00:20:47,160 --> 00:20:49,020
I have a way to make the money back.

363
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:50,290
Please, Chief Du,

364
00:20:50,610 --> 00:20:51,610
give me a chance.

365
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:53,330
A chance to do what?

366
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:57,440
Do I tell you here?

367
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,530
Everyone, leave us.

368
00:21:18,050 --> 00:21:19,000
Were you scared?

369
00:21:26,210 --> 00:21:27,450
Terrified.

370
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:29,600
I nearly ended up as dog food.

371
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:33,200
You weren't scared at all.

372
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:46,130
Now tell me,

373
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:49,760
what really happened
with that setup in Pangzhou?

374
00:21:52,610 --> 00:21:54,400
At first, everything went smoothly.

375
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:56,480
That old man Chen Jiarong
fell for our story,

376
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:59,210
and we got our hands
on the 50,000 silver dollars.

377
00:21:59,330 --> 00:22:00,000
But

378
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:01,890
Master Hu and the others got greedy.

379
00:22:01,890 --> 00:22:03,400
They insisted on running another scheme,

380
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:04,920
and that's when they slipped up.

381
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:06,400
Chen Jiarong invited
the two masters to the mine

382
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:08,130
under the pretext of signing a contract.

383
00:22:08,130 --> 00:22:09,370
Du Gui went with them.

384
00:22:10,330 --> 00:22:11,330
After that,

385
00:22:12,330 --> 00:22:13,990
we couldn't reach any of them.

386
00:22:14,530 --> 00:22:16,090
Then why didn't you go?

387
00:22:16,530 --> 00:22:17,640
The day it happened,

388
00:22:17,640 --> 00:22:19,500
I was out shopping with Miss Chen.

389
00:22:19,570 --> 00:22:21,530
My identity as Lin Shengxiang
hadn't been exposed,

390
00:22:21,530 --> 00:22:23,090
so I was still safe for the time being.

391
00:22:23,090 --> 00:22:23,810
Later,

392
00:22:24,050 --> 00:22:26,350
when I heard something
had happened at the mine,

393
00:22:26,350 --> 00:22:28,150
I fled Pangzhou that very night.

394
00:22:29,330 --> 00:22:31,460
Then why didn't you go back to Pujiang?

395
00:22:32,610 --> 00:22:33,570
I heard

396
00:22:34,240 --> 00:22:36,370
that your Longxuya Branch

397
00:22:36,680 --> 00:22:38,640
has been thriving here in Qianshan.

398
00:22:38,640 --> 00:22:40,640
So I took the liberty
of offering my services.

399
00:22:40,640 --> 00:22:42,090
I hope you'll take me in, Chief Du.

400
00:22:42,090 --> 00:22:44,860
Even if those four good-for-nothings

401
00:22:44,890 --> 00:22:46,860
botched the job
and it had nothing to do with you,

402
00:22:46,860 --> 00:22:49,380
plenty of people want to join my branch.

403
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:51,570
Why should I take you in?

404
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:55,200
Forgive me for speaking out of turn,

405
00:22:55,200 --> 00:22:56,870
but the Pangzhou operation failed

406
00:22:56,870 --> 00:22:58,140
because Hu Guangyuan and the others

407
00:22:58,140 --> 00:22:59,740
overestimated themselves.

408
00:23:00,290 --> 00:23:02,420
If you let me join the Longxuya Branch,

409
00:23:03,720 --> 00:23:05,580
I promise I won't disappoint you.

410
00:23:07,090 --> 00:23:09,050
Then I'd like to see

411
00:23:09,770 --> 00:23:11,530
what you're really capable of.

412
00:23:21,130 --> 00:23:22,000
Ruhui,

413
00:23:22,530 --> 00:23:24,370
you just joined the Longxuya Branch,

414
00:23:24,370 --> 00:23:25,640
and the Chief has assigned you to me.

415
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:27,170
From now on, you're with me.

416
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:30,410
Wow, not bad.

417
00:23:32,420 --> 00:23:35,680
[Silly Liang, Tianxiang Sect]

418
00:23:38,680 --> 00:23:40,680
You can't even handle spicy food,
yet you add that much of it.

419
00:23:40,680 --> 00:23:41,940
You don't understand.

420
00:23:42,050 --> 00:23:43,000
When you eat noodles out,

421
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:44,050
chili's free.

422
00:23:45,090 --> 00:23:47,240
So you might as well
add as much as you can.

423
00:23:47,240 --> 00:23:48,000
You're...

424
00:23:48,910 --> 00:23:50,020
quite the genius.

425
00:23:50,470 --> 00:23:50,950
Really?

426
00:23:51,530 --> 00:23:52,330
I think so too.

427
00:23:52,530 --> 00:23:53,460
I don't know why,

428
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:55,890
but everyone calls me Silly Liang.

429
00:23:56,610 --> 00:23:58,140
I'm actually pretty smart.

430
00:23:58,440 --> 00:24:00,810
If there's anything you don't understand,
just ask me.

431
00:24:00,810 --> 00:24:01,740
Anything at all.

432
00:24:07,770 --> 00:24:08,570
Go ahead, ask.

433
00:24:09,200 --> 00:24:10,800
I don't have anything to ask.

434
00:24:10,850 --> 00:24:12,480
Then let me tell you
about the Tianxiang Sect.

435
00:24:12,480 --> 00:24:13,000
No need.

436
00:24:13,090 --> 00:24:14,240
Our Tianxiang Sect

437
00:24:14,640 --> 00:24:15,920
has a main headquarters at the top,

438
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:17,240
with branches underneath.

439
00:24:17,240 --> 00:24:18,960
Let's start with our Longxuya Branch.

440
00:24:18,960 --> 00:24:20,090
We're experts in fortune-telling

441
00:24:20,090 --> 00:24:21,530
and good at devising schemes.

442
00:24:21,530 --> 00:24:23,460
The girls of the Yuehaitang Branch

443
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,640
specialize in conning wealthy men.

444
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:26,720
As for the Xuemengcao Branch,

445
00:24:26,720 --> 00:24:27,530
they're something else.

446
00:24:27,530 --> 00:24:29,400
They make a living dealing with the dead.

447
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:31,240
They've made a lot of money
these past two years,

448
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:32,850
so they don't scam people much anymore.

449
00:24:32,850 --> 00:24:34,050
Then there's the Muzilian Branch.

450
00:24:34,050 --> 00:24:34,850
Boss,

451
00:24:36,670 --> 00:24:38,370
I used to be with the Muzilian Branch.

452
00:24:38,370 --> 00:24:38,810
Oh,

453
00:24:39,370 --> 00:24:40,570
right.

454
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:42,050
In that case,

455
00:24:42,050 --> 00:24:44,250
let me tell you about the incantations.

456
00:24:44,640 --> 00:24:46,440
Read them first, then test them;

457
00:24:47,630 --> 00:24:49,230
strike fast, threaten slow.

458
00:24:49,770 --> 00:24:51,300
Flatter and close the deal;

459
00:24:51,640 --> 00:24:52,890
use every trick you know.

460
00:24:52,890 --> 00:24:54,490
Ten threats, nine will work.

461
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:55,480
ten...

462
00:24:55,880 --> 00:24:58,700
[Eight years ago]

463
00:24:56,770 --> 00:24:57,640
Ten...

464
00:25:00,440 --> 00:25:02,400
Ten times with flattery, nine will win.

465
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:04,200
Threaten first, then reassure.

466
00:25:04,330 --> 00:25:05,010
There's...

467
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:07,320
There's no way you won't win.

468
00:25:09,880 --> 00:25:11,740
Threats without reassurance...

469
00:25:12,920 --> 00:25:15,090
Threats without reassurance...

470
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,050
That's the mark of a fool.

471
00:25:17,050 --> 00:25:17,610
Exactly.

472
00:25:18,370 --> 00:25:19,300
How did you know?

473
00:25:20,290 --> 00:25:21,770
Isn't this basic incantation

474
00:25:21,770 --> 00:25:24,570
something every beginner
should have memorized?

475
00:25:24,570 --> 00:25:24,960
Yes.

476
00:25:25,440 --> 00:25:26,130
Yes.

477
00:25:34,050 --> 00:25:35,510
Let me get you a fresh bowl.

478
00:25:35,570 --> 00:25:36,170
It's on me.

479
00:25:36,290 --> 00:25:36,750
No need,

480
00:25:37,370 --> 00:25:38,770
no need. Just bring it as is.

481
00:25:38,770 --> 00:25:39,830
I can finish it all.

482
00:25:46,610 --> 00:25:47,530
Feels good.

483
00:25:49,440 --> 00:25:50,130
Ruhui,

484
00:25:50,640 --> 00:25:51,480
what were you

485
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:53,700
and Chief Du babbling about earlier?

486
00:25:54,480 --> 00:25:55,290
Like,

487
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:56,330
erm...

488
00:25:56,610 --> 00:25:57,330
"turf,"

489
00:25:57,640 --> 00:25:58,370
"years in,"

490
00:25:59,290 --> 00:26:01,000
and you even started barking like a dog.

491
00:26:01,000 --> 00:26:02,570
You don't know that either?

492
00:26:05,050 --> 00:26:07,250
"Turf" means asking where you're from.

493
00:26:07,530 --> 00:26:08,390
"Years in" asks

494
00:26:08,770 --> 00:26:10,630
how long you've been in the trade.

495
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:12,440
As for that "woof,"

496
00:26:12,720 --> 00:26:14,160
it wasn't a dog bark, either.

497
00:26:14,160 --> 00:26:15,360
It means three years.

498
00:26:18,920 --> 00:26:19,480
Liang,

499
00:26:20,770 --> 00:26:23,430
how long have you been
with the Longxuya Branch?

500
00:26:23,770 --> 00:26:24,430
Woof, woof.

501
00:26:27,570 --> 00:26:28,630
Seriously, Liang,

502
00:26:29,850 --> 00:26:31,090
you're quite a talent.

503
00:26:31,090 --> 00:26:31,610
Right?

504
00:26:34,290 --> 00:26:34,720
Come on in,

505
00:26:34,720 --> 00:26:35,440
Ruhui.

506
00:26:45,810 --> 00:26:46,440
You

507
00:26:47,090 --> 00:26:47,950
take that room.

508
00:26:48,050 --> 00:26:49,110
I'll take this one.

509
00:26:50,850 --> 00:26:52,370
Master Du doesn't live with us?

510
00:26:52,370 --> 00:26:53,300
Are you kidding?

511
00:26:53,480 --> 00:26:54,850
He's the Chief of the Longxuya Branch.

512
00:26:54,850 --> 00:26:56,090
You think he'd live with us?

513
00:26:56,090 --> 00:26:58,000
His own courtyard in the back is huge.

514
00:26:58,000 --> 00:26:58,770
Get some sleep.

515
00:26:58,770 --> 00:26:59,770
See you tomorrow.

516
00:27:39,640 --> 00:27:40,890
I've had too much chili.

517
00:27:40,890 --> 00:27:42,160
Too much chili.

518
00:27:58,200 --> 00:27:58,770
Hurry!

519
00:28:04,370 --> 00:28:04,850
Move.

520
00:28:07,130 --> 00:28:07,730
All right,

521
00:28:07,810 --> 00:28:08,540
carry it out.

522
00:28:11,480 --> 00:28:12,440
Put it down.

523
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:20,490
All right, carry it out.

524
00:28:21,330 --> 00:28:21,990
Bring it up.

525
00:28:22,210 --> 00:28:22,850
What's that smell?

526
00:28:22,850 --> 00:28:23,400
Hurry!

527
00:28:25,050 --> 00:28:25,850
Hurry!

528
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:26,640
Come here.

529
00:28:29,850 --> 00:28:30,450
All right,

530
00:28:30,530 --> 00:28:31,260
carry it out.

531
00:28:43,890 --> 00:28:44,720
Easy, Sir.

532
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:46,000
This way, please.

533
00:29:14,160 --> 00:29:15,130
Ruhui,

534
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:17,750
Ruhui,

535
00:29:21,760 --> 00:29:23,160
why are you still asleep?

536
00:29:23,400 --> 00:29:24,270
Liang.

537
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:25,220
Good morning.

538
00:29:25,220 --> 00:29:27,150
Morning? It's already afternoon.

539
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:28,720
I have a bad habit of sleeping in.

540
00:29:28,720 --> 00:29:29,520
Don't mind me.

541
00:29:29,870 --> 00:29:31,060
Get dressed.

542
00:29:31,090 --> 00:29:32,020
Come out with me.

543
00:29:33,240 --> 00:29:34,770
Where are we working today,

544
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:35,960
south of the city or north of the city?

545
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:36,960
What business?

546
00:29:37,130 --> 00:29:39,130
We've got something to take care of.

547
00:29:40,270 --> 00:29:44,460
[Taiping Taoist Temple]

548
00:29:42,440 --> 00:29:42,920
Look.

549
00:29:43,370 --> 00:29:44,530
I checked out this Taiping Taoist Temple

550
00:29:44,530 --> 00:29:46,570
when I was looking for a place before.

551
00:29:46,570 --> 00:29:48,240
It's been abandoned for quite a while.

552
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:50,100
Why are there so many people here?

553
00:29:52,290 --> 00:29:53,150
Excuse me, Sir,

554
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:54,850
what's going on in there?

555
00:29:54,850 --> 00:29:55,610
Hurry and get inside.

556
00:29:55,610 --> 00:29:56,810
It'll be dark soon.

557
00:29:57,330 --> 00:29:57,850
Wait.

558
00:29:57,920 --> 00:29:58,850
What are we going in for?

559
00:29:58,850 --> 00:30:00,290
To offer incense, of course.

560
00:30:00,290 --> 00:30:02,050
Immortal Miaoxin has manifested herself.

561
00:30:02,050 --> 00:30:03,110
Haven't you heard?

562
00:30:03,610 --> 00:30:04,200
Hurry!

563
00:30:06,570 --> 00:30:08,000
Immortal Miaoxin?

564
00:30:09,130 --> 00:30:09,570
Okay.

565
00:30:10,370 --> 00:30:11,960
Copying me and staking a claim, huh?

566
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:12,960
Come on, let's go take a look.

567
00:30:12,960 --> 00:30:13,570
Let's go.

568
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:15,310
Coming through, coming through.

569
00:30:15,310 --> 00:30:16,510
Thank you, thank you.

570
00:30:16,640 --> 00:30:17,430
Thank you.

571
00:30:17,610 --> 00:30:19,330
Coming through.

572
00:30:19,610 --> 00:30:20,210
Thank you.

573
00:30:20,290 --> 00:30:21,890
Excuse me.

574
00:30:21,960 --> 00:30:23,290
Thank you.

575
00:30:25,480 --> 00:30:26,050
Thank you, Ma'am.

576
00:30:26,050 --> 00:30:26,960
Thank you.

577
00:30:28,160 --> 00:30:29,050
Sorry.

578
00:30:33,530 --> 00:30:35,060
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

579
00:30:35,850 --> 00:30:37,380
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

580
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:39,360
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

581
00:30:39,360 --> 00:30:40,380
Two bucks for thick incense,

582
00:30:40,380 --> 00:30:41,450
one for thin.

583
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:43,600
That's some pricey incense.

584
00:30:44,330 --> 00:30:45,610
Whether you find it expensive

585
00:30:45,610 --> 00:30:46,720
depends on

586
00:30:46,850 --> 00:30:48,000
how sincere you are.

587
00:30:48,330 --> 00:30:48,960
Exactly.

588
00:30:49,330 --> 00:30:51,200
See that statue of Immortal Miaoxin?

589
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:53,050
It rises another inch
above the ground every day.

590
00:30:53,050 --> 00:30:54,810
As long as we worship with sincere hearts,

591
00:30:54,810 --> 00:30:56,330
in 49 days,

592
00:30:56,440 --> 00:30:57,570
Immortal Miaoxin
will emerge from the earth

593
00:30:57,570 --> 00:30:59,100
and bless the local people.

594
00:30:59,160 --> 00:31:00,620
The more incense we offer,

595
00:31:00,770 --> 00:31:02,200
the greater the blessings.

596
00:31:02,200 --> 00:31:03,580
Really?

597
00:31:03,610 --> 00:31:04,810
You don't believe me?

598
00:31:05,530 --> 00:31:06,160
Young man,

599
00:31:06,290 --> 00:31:07,760
I've seen it with my own eyes.

600
00:31:07,760 --> 00:31:08,440
In just half a day,

601
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:09,640
the statue has already

602
00:31:09,640 --> 00:31:11,050
emerged quite a bit.

603
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:14,400
Excuse me,

604
00:31:14,720 --> 00:31:15,960
if I may ask,

605
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:18,130
who exactly is this immortal?

606
00:31:18,480 --> 00:31:20,680
How come I've never heard of her before?

607
00:31:20,810 --> 00:31:22,130
Are you offering incense or not?

608
00:31:22,130 --> 00:31:23,530
Don't be disrespectful.

609
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:25,340
You'll disturb the Immortal.

610
00:31:25,530 --> 00:31:26,240
I will.

611
00:31:26,530 --> 00:31:27,460
Of course I will.

612
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:30,320
Put your incense money here.

613
00:31:33,290 --> 00:31:33,770
What are you doing?

614
00:31:33,770 --> 00:31:34,570
What, you bought me a bowl of noodles

615
00:31:34,570 --> 00:31:35,530
and want the money back?

616
00:31:35,530 --> 00:31:37,530
I'm borrowing it, aren't I? It's not like
I'm not going to pay you back.

617
00:31:37,530 --> 00:31:37,960
Wait,

618
00:31:38,090 --> 00:31:39,440
it's not that I'm being stingy.

619
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:40,890
I need this money tonight.

620
00:31:40,890 --> 00:31:41,720
Tonight?

621
00:31:41,800 --> 00:31:43,330
Then we'll deal with it tonight.

622
00:31:43,330 --> 00:31:43,960
What are you doing?

623
00:31:43,960 --> 00:31:45,220
You're robbing me now?

624
00:31:48,330 --> 00:31:49,390
What are you doing?

625
00:31:50,000 --> 00:31:51,060
What are you doing?

626
00:31:55,930 --> 00:31:56,920
You insolent boy.

627
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:59,290
You're showing disrespect to the Immortal.

628
00:31:59,290 --> 00:32:00,240
I'm sorry.

629
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:03,130
But why are there so many bean sprouts?

630
00:32:04,770 --> 00:32:05,570
Bean sprouts?

631
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,050
I get it.

632
00:32:09,130 --> 00:32:10,810
They buried soybeans ahead of time,

633
00:32:10,810 --> 00:32:11,890
let them sprout,

634
00:32:11,960 --> 00:32:14,770
and the growing sprouts pushed the statue
out of the ground.

635
00:32:14,770 --> 00:32:16,570
He's probably a fraud.

636
00:32:27,130 --> 00:32:28,130
Easy,

637
00:32:28,130 --> 00:32:29,440
easy!

638
00:32:43,130 --> 00:32:44,200
Easy!

639
00:32:44,370 --> 00:32:45,440
Easy!

640
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:49,610
Easy!

641
00:32:52,500 --> 00:32:53,740
Ruhui,

642
00:32:54,000 --> 00:32:56,460
how did you figure out
how they were doing it?

643
00:32:56,920 --> 00:32:58,960
These cheap tricks for fooling children

644
00:32:58,960 --> 00:33:00,330
are nothing new to me.

645
00:33:00,950 --> 00:33:02,530
What about that auspicious purple smoke?

646
00:33:02,530 --> 00:33:03,590
How did you do that?

647
00:33:03,610 --> 00:33:04,810
Get some iodine

648
00:33:04,850 --> 00:33:05,650
and aluminum,

649
00:33:05,900 --> 00:33:07,290
and throw them into water together.

650
00:33:07,290 --> 00:33:08,890
It'll produce purple smoke.

651
00:33:09,530 --> 00:33:10,370
And...

652
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:13,090
what about that trick
where the Immortals ate the noodles?

653
00:33:13,090 --> 00:33:14,750
That trick looks mysterious,

654
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:16,290
but it's actually incredibly simple.

655
00:33:16,290 --> 00:33:17,130
Simply put,

656
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:18,130
it's honey.

657
00:33:18,160 --> 00:33:18,770
Honey?

658
00:33:18,890 --> 00:33:20,610
Honey contains an enzyme called amylase

659
00:33:20,610 --> 00:33:22,140
that can break down starch.

660
00:33:22,160 --> 00:33:23,890
I put honey in those Immortals' bowls

661
00:33:23,890 --> 00:33:24,720
beforehand.

662
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:25,770
By the time I finished my noodles,

663
00:33:25,770 --> 00:33:26,960
exactly 15 minutes had passed,

664
00:33:26,960 --> 00:33:28,130
and the noodles in that bowl

665
00:33:28,130 --> 00:33:29,660
had completely dissolved.

666
00:33:31,090 --> 00:33:31,820
What enzyme?

667
00:33:32,810 --> 00:33:33,850
Amylase.

668
00:33:34,610 --> 00:33:36,870
It's something Westerners discovered.

669
00:33:39,290 --> 00:33:40,200
An enzyme?

670
00:33:41,240 --> 00:33:42,370
Don't overthink it.

671
00:33:43,090 --> 00:33:44,000
Just remember,

672
00:33:44,330 --> 00:33:45,290
it was the honey.

673
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:47,770
Either way,

674
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:48,720
you did

675
00:33:48,770 --> 00:33:49,770
a great job today.

676
00:33:50,610 --> 00:33:51,330
Ruhui,

677
00:33:51,530 --> 00:33:52,330
from now on,

678
00:33:52,550 --> 00:33:55,550
you're officially a disciple
of the Longxuya Branch.

679
00:33:57,770 --> 00:33:58,920
Thanks for taking me
under your wing, Liang.

680
00:33:58,920 --> 00:33:59,810
All right.

681
00:34:00,530 --> 00:34:02,770
Tonight, I'll show you a thing or two

682
00:34:03,720 --> 00:34:05,320
and celebrate your success.

683
00:34:05,810 --> 00:34:06,890
In our branch,

684
00:34:07,000 --> 00:34:08,290
only those who've done great deeds

685
00:34:08,290 --> 00:34:10,219
get to come to this pleasure house.

686
00:34:10,560 --> 00:34:11,290
Liang,

687
00:34:12,920 --> 00:34:14,210
how many times have you been here?

688
00:34:14,210 --> 00:34:14,690
Me?

689
00:34:15,170 --> 00:34:16,230
I come every month.

690
00:34:16,600 --> 00:34:17,530
I'm telling you,

691
00:34:17,889 --> 00:34:19,290
we're the big shots here.

692
00:34:19,440 --> 00:34:21,239
These girls are here to serve us.

693
00:34:21,250 --> 00:34:22,560
Don't be so shy.

694
00:34:22,600 --> 00:34:22,960
Let's go.

695
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:23,650
Wait, wait.

696
00:34:26,110 --> 00:34:26,949
This doesn't feel right.

697
00:34:26,949 --> 00:34:28,040
What's wrong with it?

698
00:34:28,040 --> 00:34:29,040
I've seen them...

699
00:34:29,690 --> 00:34:31,000
This is how I've always done it.

700
00:34:31,000 --> 00:34:31,929
Come on, come on.

701
00:34:32,480 --> 00:34:33,010
Let's go.

702
00:34:34,480 --> 00:34:35,340
Right this way.

703
00:34:35,730 --> 00:34:36,040
Go ahead.

704
00:34:36,040 --> 00:34:37,520
You first.

705
00:34:38,440 --> 00:34:39,300
No, no,

706
00:34:39,330 --> 00:34:40,330
I'll go myself.

707
00:34:45,250 --> 00:34:45,850
Sir,

708
00:34:46,810 --> 00:34:47,690
please.

709
00:35:02,690 --> 00:35:03,440
So,

710
00:35:05,690 --> 00:35:07,090
how old are you this year?

711
00:35:08,520 --> 00:35:09,450
I'm 14 years old.

712
00:35:15,280 --> 00:35:16,220
Wait, wait.

713
00:35:23,370 --> 00:35:24,700
I've had too much to drink.

714
00:35:24,700 --> 00:35:25,570
Mind if I rest here

715
00:35:25,570 --> 00:35:26,420
for a bit?

716
00:35:26,520 --> 00:35:27,370
Make yourself comfortable.

717
00:35:27,370 --> 00:35:28,810
Just wake me

718
00:35:28,920 --> 00:35:30,380
when my friend is leaving.

719
00:35:54,480 --> 00:35:55,480
Ruhui,

720
00:35:56,000 --> 00:35:57,690
how was your night?

721
00:35:59,210 --> 00:35:59,940
Pretty good.

722
00:36:00,040 --> 00:36:00,770
Pretty good.

723
00:36:01,600 --> 00:36:02,250
Liang,

724
00:36:02,400 --> 00:36:03,250
what about your?

725
00:36:03,250 --> 00:36:04,370
Mine was pretty good too.

726
00:36:04,370 --> 00:36:05,210
Ruhui,

727
00:36:07,110 --> 00:36:08,570
the Chief wants to see you.

728
00:36:09,210 --> 00:36:10,850
The Chief is probably
going to reward you.

729
00:36:10,850 --> 00:36:11,910
I'll come with you.

730
00:36:12,480 --> 00:36:13,280
The Chief said

731
00:36:13,690 --> 00:36:15,220
he wants only Ruhui to come.

732
00:36:18,520 --> 00:36:19,050
Let's go.

733
00:36:31,520 --> 00:36:32,210
Go in.

734
00:37:07,120 --> 00:37:09,600
There's a little phosphorus powder
in the candle wick.

735
00:37:09,600 --> 00:37:10,660
Just a cheap trick.

736
00:37:11,250 --> 00:37:14,120
Nothing compared to your earlier tricks.

737
00:37:17,210 --> 00:37:19,210
Chief, you summoned me here so late.

738
00:37:19,290 --> 00:37:20,420
What can I do for you?

739
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:22,850
Why

740
00:37:23,560 --> 00:37:24,850
didn't you do it?

741
00:37:25,910 --> 00:37:26,800
Do what?

742
00:37:27,920 --> 00:37:29,370
With that girl.

743
00:37:33,170 --> 00:37:34,300
You know about that?

744
00:37:35,170 --> 00:37:37,650
As the head of this branch,

745
00:37:38,250 --> 00:37:40,910
I have to have a few eyes
and ears around, don't I?

746
00:37:42,440 --> 00:37:45,560
I heard you took down another claim.

747
00:37:46,560 --> 00:37:47,560
Nicely done.

748
00:37:48,850 --> 00:37:50,650
Thank you for the praise, Chief.

749
00:37:52,250 --> 00:37:53,170
Ruhui,

750
00:37:53,690 --> 00:37:55,850
what do you think of me?

751
00:37:56,560 --> 00:37:57,290
Pretty good.

752
00:37:58,170 --> 00:37:58,890
Pretty good.

753
00:37:58,890 --> 00:37:59,960
Pretty good?

754
00:38:01,480 --> 00:38:03,330
Am I good at deceiving people,

755
00:38:03,440 --> 00:38:05,170
or good at killing them?

756
00:38:06,850 --> 00:38:07,520
Tell me,

757
00:38:08,730 --> 00:38:10,080
if someone

758
00:38:11,480 --> 00:38:15,340
were playing tricks and pretending
to be supernatural in our branch,

759
00:38:15,650 --> 00:38:17,040
trying to kill me,

760
00:38:19,120 --> 00:38:20,720
what do you think I should do?

761
00:38:23,080 --> 00:38:25,340
I don't understand what you mean, Chief.

762
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:28,730
Pick it up.

763
00:38:35,600 --> 00:38:36,330
Why don't I

764
00:38:36,850 --> 00:38:39,440
take you as my final disciple?

765
00:38:40,120 --> 00:38:41,850
I'm not worthy of such an honor.

766
00:38:42,330 --> 00:38:44,330
If I say you're worthy, then you are.

767
00:38:45,080 --> 00:38:45,890
But

768
00:38:46,600 --> 00:38:49,260
if you're going
to be Blind Du's final disciple,

769
00:38:49,520 --> 00:38:51,650
you'll have to be a blind man yourself.

770
00:38:51,690 --> 00:38:53,440
You have to use the knife in your hand

771
00:38:53,440 --> 00:38:55,330
to cut out your own eyes.

772
00:38:56,730 --> 00:38:57,660
Don't be afraid.

773
00:38:58,170 --> 00:39:00,080
Just bear it for a moment,
and it'll be over.

774
00:39:00,080 --> 00:39:02,250
If you really
can't bring yourself to do it...

775
00:39:02,250 --> 00:39:04,400
Your fate is marked by raging Fire,

776
00:39:04,600 --> 00:39:07,530
while Miss Feiyan
is destined to be ill-fated Water.

777
00:39:07,600 --> 00:39:09,440
Water and Fire are naturally incompatible.

778
00:39:09,440 --> 00:39:12,120
If the two of you insist
on being together,

779
00:39:12,330 --> 00:39:14,210
disaster will surely befall your family.

780
00:39:14,210 --> 00:39:15,470
What kind of disaster?

781
00:39:15,730 --> 00:39:16,890
Your entire family

782
00:39:17,690 --> 00:39:19,290
will be dead within a month.

783
00:39:21,290 --> 00:39:23,960
Blind Du made me do it.

784
00:39:24,520 --> 00:39:27,930
Southern Immortal Elder wants to take them
as immortal children.

785
00:39:27,930 --> 00:39:30,520
How could mere mortals like us
hope to stop him?

786
00:39:30,520 --> 00:39:32,170
What can I do

787
00:39:32,810 --> 00:39:35,040
to get revenge on the Tianxiang Sect?

788
00:39:35,650 --> 00:39:37,040
If you want revenge,

789
00:39:37,370 --> 00:39:39,000
you have to know the Tianxiang Sect

790
00:39:39,000 --> 00:39:40,650
better than anyone.

791
00:39:41,080 --> 00:39:42,370
You have to predict

792
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:43,690
their every move

793
00:39:44,120 --> 00:39:45,690
and see through every scheme they make.

794
00:39:45,690 --> 00:39:46,690
Only then

795
00:39:48,600 --> 00:39:50,060
can you have your revenge.

796
00:39:53,520 --> 00:39:54,120
What?

797
00:39:54,520 --> 00:39:55,520
You don't want to?

798
00:39:55,960 --> 00:39:58,090
Do you look down on my Longxuya Branch?

799
00:39:59,290 --> 00:40:00,090
Of course not.

800
00:40:00,290 --> 00:40:02,080
It's just that I already have a mentor.

801
00:40:02,080 --> 00:40:03,560
The Tianxiang Sect has its rules.

802
00:40:03,560 --> 00:40:04,960
Changing allegiance
without your mentor's permission

803
00:40:04,960 --> 00:40:06,370
would be no different

804
00:40:06,650 --> 00:40:09,040
from betraying your mentor
and forsaking your sect.

805
00:40:09,040 --> 00:40:11,290
How could I, Ruhui,
be so disloyal and unfilial?

806
00:40:11,290 --> 00:40:13,150
I hope you'll understand, Chief.

807
00:40:13,850 --> 00:40:15,600
Then who is your mentor?

808
00:40:17,120 --> 00:40:17,920
Jin Buhuan.

809
00:40:18,770 --> 00:40:19,560
Could you

810
00:40:19,730 --> 00:40:21,530
arrange for us to meet sometime?

811
00:40:24,520 --> 00:40:25,770
Certainly.

812
00:40:28,650 --> 00:40:29,920
The road ahead

813
00:40:29,920 --> 00:40:31,380
is like brewing medicine—

814
00:40:31,730 --> 00:40:33,250
it takes patience

815
00:40:33,730 --> 00:40:35,460
and a slow simmer over low heat.

816
00:40:35,520 --> 00:40:36,600
Lyu Ruhui

817
00:40:36,850 --> 00:40:38,370
loves lurking in dark places,

818
00:40:38,370 --> 00:40:40,370
like a bat that can't stand the sun.

819
00:40:41,290 --> 00:40:42,170
He killed

820
00:40:42,290 --> 00:40:44,150
your younger siblings back then,

821
00:40:44,770 --> 00:40:46,600
but he never saw your face.

822
00:40:47,560 --> 00:40:48,760
This dose of bat guano

823
00:40:49,100 --> 00:40:50,370
is perfect for him.

824
00:40:51,560 --> 00:40:53,690
This one needs a quick boil
over high heat.

825
00:40:53,690 --> 00:40:54,820
Swift and decisive.

826
00:40:59,080 --> 00:41:00,370
This cinnabar,

827
00:41:00,600 --> 00:41:02,520
red as blood,

828
00:41:03,250 --> 00:41:04,380
is for Old Madam Zhu.

829
00:41:04,400 --> 00:41:05,800
It'll add a touch of color

830
00:41:05,890 --> 00:41:07,330
to her rouge.

831
00:41:07,920 --> 00:41:08,730
Bring it

832
00:41:08,920 --> 00:41:11,250
to a rapid boil over high heat,

833
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:12,690
then add the medicine and stir gently

834
00:41:12,690 --> 00:41:14,120
along the rising steam from the pot.

835
00:41:14,120 --> 00:41:15,730
Don't let her get away.

836
00:41:20,650 --> 00:41:22,290
As for Blind Du,

837
00:41:23,370 --> 00:41:24,400
this cassia seed

838
00:41:25,000 --> 00:41:26,530
should help clear his eyes.

839
00:41:36,290 --> 00:41:37,690
What about Jiang Feiyan?

840
00:41:39,960 --> 00:41:42,360
She's the one I want
to get my hands on first.

841
00:41:46,960 --> 00:41:48,890
This medicine is unstable.

842
00:41:49,690 --> 00:41:51,350
If you can't control the heat,

843
00:41:51,730 --> 00:41:52,990
it'll turn poisonous.

844
00:41:53,730 --> 00:41:54,930
So remember:

845
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:57,460
the later you prepare this dose,
the better.

846
00:42:25,690 --> 00:42:27,870
[In the next episode]

847
00:42:28,080 --> 00:42:30,200
Copper bells lead the way

848
00:42:30,590 --> 00:42:32,700
as the dead are escorted home.

849
00:42:33,030 --> 00:42:34,690
One of the corpses has turned!

850
00:42:35,220 --> 00:42:36,720
When a corpse turns on the way home,

851
00:42:36,720 --> 00:42:38,280
it's either because the dead
bore a grievance in life

852
00:42:38,280 --> 00:42:39,730
or met with misfortune after death.

853
00:42:39,730 --> 00:42:41,090
You're dressed

854
00:42:41,530 --> 00:42:43,180
as if you were about to perform in a play.

855
00:42:43,180 --> 00:42:44,710
I'll put you somewhere else

856
00:42:44,740 --> 00:42:46,180
so you can cool off.

857
00:42:50,920 --> 00:42:52,600
Everyone who's ever been good to me

858
00:42:52,600 --> 00:42:53,840
ends up

859
00:42:54,010 --> 00:42:55,490
dead because of me.
